		"description": "<p><em>Gadget — Leap 8 spaces free of Restrained/Grappled with no fall damage.</em></p><p><strong>1 Action.</strong> Lose Restrained/Grappled and leap 8 spaces. You take no fall damage.</p><p><strong>Toolbelt:</strong> Burst 1, Damage: 5+LVL around your starting space and on landing. On hit: inflict Smoldering. Ignores armor.</p><p><strong>Passive:</strong> Take half damage from falling.</p><hr><p><em>[A] Grants the Rocket Boots gadget item (activation, 1 scrap) and the \"Rocket Boots (Toolbelt)\" feature (upgrade, 2 scraps); both spend from your Toolbelt pool — tracked on the sheet (click the counter to correct mistakes).</em></p><p><em>[M] Passive: Half damage from falling — halve it when applying.</em></p>",
